    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="68.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 68.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Be unstrangan. Forðam a man sceal ðam unstrangan men for Godes lufan ⁊ for his ege liðelicor deman ⁊ scrifan ðonne ðam strangan;</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Concerning the weak. For the fear of God and out of reverence to him, greater leniency shall always be shown in passing judgment and in imposing penance upon the weak than [in doing so] upon the strong.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Forðam á man sceal þam unstrangan men for Godes lufe ⁊ ége liþelicor deman ⁊ scrifon þonne þam strangan;</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
